{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026lLz61ZJuEY1792728322.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網絡流傳影片，直擊旺角亞皆老街與洗衣街交界，有一對男女在馬路上激烈拉扯。片中一名穿背心的女子坐在小巴旁，情緒失控地不斷哭喊「救命呀」、「我求下你」，身旁男子試圖拉她離開時，二人更齊齊倒在地板上，男子起身再嘗試拉走女子時，女子再度倒地並大叫「好痛」、「報警拉你」，場面相當混亂。</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-23-11h27m11s422.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026I68RRttTMr1792728263.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-23-11h26m52s338.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bttK23sQAV1792728277.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>警方於昨日（22日）晚上9時29分接獲報案，指一名女子躺在上址路口，懷疑被小巴撞到。警員及救護員隨即趕到現場調查，涉案42歲姓蔡女子原本相約38歲姓張丈夫在上址見面，惟丈夫懷疑去錯地點，蔡女在現場等了約半小時後情緒激動，遂衝出馬路倒地。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:03:52.541680+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T04:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T20:18:20.772045+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:58:06.464823+00:00","content_hash":"4bd71170619e70abe38a2c32659399dd384e2eda5aec045e0816798b57f95d2e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:03:52.541680+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}